## $\displaystyle \Gamma _0 = \alpha _0: x \in \mathbb{R}, \langle\text{static}\rangle\ a \in \mathbb{R}, \langle\text{static}\rangle\ b \in \mathbb{R}, \langle \text{static} \rangle u \in \mathbb{R} \backslash \{- 1\}$

$\displaystyle \mathbf{ctx}\ \langle \text{换元法} \rangle: u = a x + b$
$\displaystyle \color{Grey} \text{d} u = a \ \text{d} x$
$\displaystyle \text{d} x = \frac{1}{a} \ \text{d} u$

## $\displaystyle \Gamma _1 = \alpha _1: \alpha _0 + \langle \text{换元法} \rangle$

$\displaystyle \int (a x + b) ^\mu \ \text{d} x$
$\displaystyle = \frac{1}{a} \int u ^{\mu} \ \text{d} u$

$\displaystyle [\mathbb{R}::int]\ \mathbf{ori}\ C \in \mathbb R$
$\displaystyle = \frac{1}{a} \frac{1}{\mu + 1} u ^{\mu + 1}+ \color{Cyan} C$
$\displaystyle = \frac{1}{a (\mu + 1)} u ^{\mu + 1}+ \color{Cyan} C$

## $\displaystyle \Gamma _1 = \Gamma _0 + \langle \text{换元法} \rangle$

$\displaystyle = \frac{1}{a (\mu + 1)} (a x + b)^{\mu + 1} + C$
